# Cloudflare Pages headers. Vite copies public/ to the build output root, so
# this ends up at dist/_headers where Pages picks it up.
#
# Cross-origin isolation is required for SharedArrayBuffer, which onnxruntime-web
# needs to run the chess engine on threaded wasm (ort-wasm-simd-threaded). Without
# these headers it silently falls back to single-threaded and the engine is slower.
# Mirrors the dev/preview server headers in vite.config.ts.
#
# COEP is `credentialless` (not `require-corp`) so cross-origin subresources —
# the gallery photos on photos.hunterchen.ca — keep loading without needing CORP
# headers; they are simply fetched without credentials.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
